{{!
    @template mod_tarsus/learn_complete_card

    The brain's farewell once every learning objective is done (the
    success widget): a green-bordered card with the artwork, a title and
    the message.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * title - string, the brain's title; empty falls back to the plugin's own.
    * text - string, server-cleaned HTML of the message (output unescaped).
}}
<div class="tarsus-card tarsus-card--welcome tarsus-learn-card--complete" data-region="learn-complete">
    <div class="tarsus-card__inner text-center">
        <div class="tarsus-welcome-art">{{#pix}}success, mod_tarsus{{/pix}}</div>
        <h3 class="tarsus-card__title">{{#title}}{{title}}{{/title}}{{^title}}{{#str}}learn_complete_title, mod_tarsus{{/str}}{{/title}}</h3>
        <div class="tarsus-card__welcome-text">{{{text}}}</div>
    </div>
</div>
